# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AQUASEE inquiry delivery configuration
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in ONE of the options below.
# The inquiry form works without any of these, but it will only be able to
# return a local acknowledgement (and a mailto fallback) until a delivery
# channel is connected.
#
# On Cloudflare these values are Worker secrets, not files:
#   npx wrangler secret put SMTP_HOST
#   npx wrangler secret put SMTP_PORT
#   ...
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Option A — Feishu Mail (飞书邮箱) over SMTP ----------------------------
# Settings come from 飞书邮箱 → 设置 → 客户端专用密码.
# Host is `smtp.feishu.cn`; port 465 uses SSL, 587 uses STARTTLS.
# The username is the full mailbox address and the password is the
# client-specific password (授权码), not the account login password.
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.feishu.cn
# SMTP_PORT=465
# SMTP_SECURE=true
# SMTP_USER=victor@aquasee.art
# SMTP_PASS=your-client-specific-password
# INQUIRY_TO_EMAIL=victor@aquasee.art
# INQUIRY_FROM_EMAIL=website@aquasee.art

# --- Option B — Generic webhook (Zapier / Make / n8n / Formspree-compatible) --
# The API route POSTs the validated inquiry payload as JSON.
# INQUIRY_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.example.com/your-hook
# Optional — shared secret sent with the webhook for endpoint verification.
# INQUIRY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=replace-me

# --- Option C — Resend HTTP API ---------------------------------------------
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# INQUIRY_TO_EMAIL=victor@aquasee.art
# INQUIRY_FROM_EMAIL=website@aquasee.art
